              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Citing Sources",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Require inline markers like `[doc3#p2]` that map to ids the tool returned",
                "Render them as ==links== or footnotes",
                "Validate cited ids in code against this run's tool results",
                "Unknown id → {red:reject} and regenerate",
                "The regex matches the tool's id format"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import re",
                "seen = {'doc3#p2'}",
                "answer = 'Pro is $9 [doc3#p2] [doc9#p1]'",
                "print(set(re.findall(r'\\[(doc\\d+#p\\d+)\\]', answer)) - seen)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "{'doc9#p1'}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Failure Modes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Failure",
                "Fixed",
                "Agentic"
